      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. SOCIAL & TECHNOLOGICAL TRANSFORMATION"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2xbs412",
      "content": "• Green Revolution &amp; White Revolution."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ti1qv3w",
      "content": "• Operation Flood (Milk Revolution)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "t0p69x1",
      "content": "• ISRO established (1969)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tni25ol",
      "content": "• IT Revolution (1990s onwards)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "blicy4h",
      "content": "• Digital India &amp; Startup ecosystem."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "370uumo",
      "content": "• Aadhaar &amp; Direct Benefit Transfer reforms."
    },
    {
      "id": "l8tv4zm",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "8. CONSTITUTIONAL & ADMINISTRATIVE FOUNDATIONS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "y8jvqvb",
      "content": "• Constituent Assembly formed (1946); Constitution adopted on 26 Nov 1949."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "eaoyqrj",
      "content": "• Republic of India declared on 26 January 1950."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1ugg2ak",
      "content": "• Reorganization of States Act (1956)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7lkdjwr",
      "content": "• 73rd &amp; 74th Constitutional Amendments (1992) — Panchayati Raj &amp; Urban Local Bodies."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fsbqzx2",
      "content": "• Right to Information Act (2005)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2lsf5sn",
      "content": "• Goods and Services Tax (2017)."
    },
    {
      "id": "qy29ca8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9. POLITICAL PHASES AFTER 1947"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "c11hkzl",
      "content": "• One-party dominance era (1952–1967)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "eofoqbz",
      "content": "• Coalition &amp; regional politics (1967 onwards)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "g4ucwam",
      "content": "• National Emergency (1975–77)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fjzygg8",
      "content": "• Rise of coalition governments (1989–2014)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mmq621s",
      "content": "• Era of majority governments (2014 onwards)."
    },
    {
